flowchart TB
accTitle: Latency preference is constrained by endpoint health
accDescr: Route 53 returns a latency-selected healthy regional ALB. If the preferred Region is unhealthy, a healthy alternate is selected for new DNS answers.
Q[Public DNS query]:::inputData --> R[Route 53 latency records]:::process
H1[Region A ALB health]:::inputData -.-> R
H2[Region B ALB health]:::inputData -.-> R
R --> C{Lowest-latency candidate healthy?}:::decision
C -->|Yes| A[Return candidate ALB address]:::output
C -->|No, other Region healthy| B[Return alternate ALB address]:::output
N[Cached answers and existing connections may persist]:::warning -.-> Q
